    debug_symbol n [BP-08h] type=0x24 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x02
    debug_symbol ref [BP-10h] type=0x69 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
    debug_symbol notAlarmed [BP-11h] type=0x62 unk1=0x00 unk3=0x00
